// **an `&` the author wrote over a non-place is still an error**, and that is what makes todo/A13c need
// no flag on the node: an AddrOfExprNode over a non-place is, by construction, one the compiler wrote.
// the parser refuses this spelling before any of it, so only an *implicit* borrow ever materialises
// storage

function inc(int32& $x) : int32
{
    return $x;
}

echo inc(&5);
